                    briefing_1:  `Welcome to NexaCore Solutions. You have just been appointed VP of Sales for a B2B enterprise software company with $45M ARR and a 32-person sales force. The situation is urgent: quota attainment has dropped to 54%, top talent is leaving at 18% annually, and the sales pipeline is bloated at 7.2x coverage. Territory workload variance sits at 45% — far above the healthy 15% threshold.<br><br>Start by diagnosing the territory imbalance and setting your initial compensation philosophy.`,
